49,"defaultCountryId":57,"monotypeTitle":58},"Postage to Switzerland",null,{},"a parcel from £10.79",{"link_type":50,"key":51,"kind":52,"id":53,"url":54,"name":55,"size":56},"Media","d6d3fb8d-8984-477f-a618-6c78cefe090c","file","ZCwNmBEAACIAAJpg","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdf0da68b-7584-4eca-a656-20f4b8338e1a_destination_countries_030423.csv","destination_countries_030423.csv","5329","190",{},"international_hero_banner$cee0ba76-e689-4186-917e-745ad7dc7dba","international_hero_banner",{"variation":62,"version":31,"items":63,"primary":65,"id":97,"slice_type":98,"slice_label":46},"cardWithImageNoCta",[64],{},{"CardImage":66,"CardAvatar":77,"CardTitle":78,"CardText":79,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":67,"alt":70,"copyright":46,"url":71,"id":72,"edit":73},{"width":68,"height":69},1000,670,"An aerial scene of Thun City and lake in the Swiss Alps","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a4340fa-3dc7-4006-8581-16b1a139b9ff_Resize+file+1000x670_0002_Switzerland.jpg?auto=compress,format","ZiEUMREAACYAsVsd",{"x":74,"y":74,"zoom":75,"background":76},0,1,"#fff","none","Shipping to Switzerland from the UK",[80,85],{"type":81,"text":82,"spans":83,"direction":84},"paragraph","Home to one of the most thriving economies in the world, alongside incredible snowy mountain vistas, Switzerland is a surprisingly popular destination for parcels coming from the UK.",[],"ltr",{"type":81,"text":86,"spans":87,"direction":84},"From dropping off packages in the historic capital of Bern to delivering parcels across the Alps and into Italy, your Evri courier will make sure your parcel arrives safely and quickly.",[88,95],{"start":89,"end":90,"type":91,"data":92},106,111,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":93,"target":94},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fitaly","_blank",{"start":89,"end":90,"type":96},"strong","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":100,"version":31,"items":101,"primary":116,"id":125,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[102,105,107,110,113],{"Col1Content":103,"Col2Content":104},"250g","£10.79",{"Col1Content":106,"Col2Content":104},"500kg",{"Col1Content":108,"Col2Content":109},"1kg","£11.89",{"Col1Content":111,"Col2Content":112},"2kg","£15.49",{"Col1Content":114,"Col2Content":115},"5kg+","£19.89",{"SectionTitle":117,"SectionSubtitle":118,"Col1Header":119,"Col2Header":120,"InformationTableButtonUrl":121,"InformationTableButtonText":124,"isTableShort":20},"How much is postage to Switzerland from the UK?","No matter where in Europe you need to send your packages, you’re sure to get a reliable service at a great price with Evri, including when you need to send a parcel to Switzerland.\n\nIf your parcel weighs 15kg or less, our couriers will be able to handle your delivery. Take a look at our pricing table below to see how cheap it is to send a parcel to Switzerland:","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":122,"url":123},"888d1041-a353-4f60-adde-62dd1caa6b47","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Switzerland","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":129,"primary":131,"id":162,"slice_type":98,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[130],{},{"CardAvatar":77,"CardTitle":132,"CardText":133,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":160,"IsEco":20},"Swiss public holidays to be aware of",[134,137,143,148,153,157],{"type":81,"text":135,"spans":136,"direction":84},"While our international courier service always aims to get your parcel to its destination on time, delivery times may be increased if your parcel is due to arrive in Switzerland around any of the following public holidays:",[],{"type":138,"text":139,"spans":140,"direction":84},"list-item","New Year’s Day: 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[141],{"start":74,"end":142,"type":96},16,{"type":138,"text":144,"spans":145,"direction":84},"Ascension Day: 14\u002F05\u002F2026",[146],{"start":74,"end":147,"type":96},14,{"type":138,"text":149,"spans":150,"direction":84},"National Day: 01\u002F08\u002F2026",[151],{"start":74,"end":152,"type":96},13,{"type":138,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":84},"Christmas Day: 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[156],{"start":74,"end":147,"type":96},{"type":81,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":84},"It’s also important to be aware that many of Switzerland’s various states have their own regional holidays as well, meaning your parcel could take slightly longer to deliver closer to those days.",[],{"link_type":161},"Any","card$cd1ea525-d9f3-4bd8-a9d1-11a31883b658",{"variation":164,"version":31,"items":165,"primary":229,"id":239,"slice_type":240,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[166,189,209],{"Title":167,"Description":172,"Image":176,"Label":46,"UrlText":170,"Url":185,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":188,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[168],{"type":169,"text":170,"spans":171},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[173],{"type":81,"text":174,"spans":175,"direction":84},"Book your package online and print your labels at home or in-store for free. Drop off at one of our 9,000 local ParcelShops near you and we’ll take care of everything from there. Did you know you can also book parcels in person at selected Post Office ParcelShops?",[],{"dimensions":177,"alt":179,"copyright":46,"url":180,"id":181,"edit":182},{"width":68,"height":178},665,"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":74,"y":183,"zoom":75,"background":184},8,"transparent",{"link_type":36,"key":186,"url":187},"fd86d2ce-b108-4813-b61f-98e428c5dead","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":161},{"Title":190,"Description":194,"Image":198,"Label":46,"UrlText":192,"Url":205,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":208,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[191],{"type":169,"text":192,"spans":193},"Lockers",[],[195],{"type":81,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":84},"Conveniently dotted throughout the UK, you can book your delivery online and drop off at an Evri parcel Locker near you. Scan your barcode when you arrive, and place your parcel in an available Locker for us to collect.",[],{"dimensions":199,"alt":200,"copyright":46,"url":201,"id":202,"edit":203},{"width":68,"height":178},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":74,"y":204,"zoom":75,"background":184},17,{"link_type":36,"key":206,"url":207},"601a4ac7-9c20-4be3-ad15-ca4e43427184","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":161},{"Title":210,"Description":214,"Image":218,"Label":46,"UrlText":224,"Url":225,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":228,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[211],{"type":169,"text":212,"spans":213,"direction":84},"Courier collection",[],[215],{"type":81,"text":216,"spans":217,"direction":84},"Unable to drop off your parcel yourself? No problem. You can book a courier collection online on a day that suits you, and we’ll come directly to your office, home, or wherever is most convenient for you. We'll even give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us.",[],{"dimensions":219,"alt":220,"copyright":46,"url":221,"id":222,"edit":223},{"width":68,"height":178},"A customer has just handed their parcel to an Evri courier as a part of a doorstep collection. The customer is being handed a blue slip as a receipt of the transaction.","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xsZbqstJ9-pVA_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1545.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8158%2C5425&w=1000&h=665","Z69xsZbqstJ9-pVA",{"x":74,"y":183,"zoom":75,"background":184},"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":226,"url":227},"aaee61d0-84a3-4875-aa3a-44af61cf043b","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":161},{"SectionTitle":230,"SectionDescription":235,"theme":46},[231],{"type":232,"text":233,"spans":234},"heading2","How to send parcels to Switzerland",[],[236],{"type":81,"text":237,"spans":238},"You can send your parcel to Switzerland using any of the following three methods:",[],"article_link_module$d1e34f38-1736-410a-96fb-091080718137","article_link_module",{"variation":242,"version":31,"items":243,"primary":245,"id":280,"slice_type":98,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[244],{},{"CardImage":246,"CardAvatar":77,"CardTitle":252,"CardText":253,"ButtonText":277,"ButtonUrl":278,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":247,"alt":248,"copyright":46,"url":249,"id":250,"edit":251},{"width":68,"height":178},"An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats.","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDp5bqstJ9-cfh_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4424.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDp5bqstJ9-cfh",{"x":74,"y":183,"zoom":75,"background":184},"Sending multiple parcels to Switzerland",[254,264,268,271,274],{"type":81,"text":255,"spans":256,"direction":84},"Need to send multiple parcels to Switzerland in one go? With our bulk integrations tool, you can quickly pull your orders together in one place and send them on their way at the same time:",[257,262],{"start":258,"end":259,"type":91,"data":260},65,87,{"link_type":36,"url":38,"target":261},"_self",{"start":258,"end":263,"type":96},88,{"type":265,"text":266,"spans":267,"direction":84},"o-list-item","Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file",[],{"type":265,"text":269,"spans":270,"direction":84},"Package up your items and book your parcels in one go",[],{"type":265,"text":272,"spans":273,"direction":84},"Print off your postage label at home or in-store",[],{"type":265,"text":275,"spans":276,"direction":84},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ UK ParcelShops and Lockers or book a courier collection",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":279,"url":38},"ca7d31da-1148-4eb0-84b2-5a2d8274d4c2","card$e6523218-14e2-4dad-8539-f1188c398d7f",{"variation":282,"version":31,"items":283,"primary":363,"id":367,"slice_type":368,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[284,303,315,327,339,351],{"title":285,"content":286,"icon":296},"Regular tracking updates",[287],{"type":81,"text":288,"spans":289,"direction":84},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[290,295],{"start":291,"end":292,"type":91,"data":293},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":294,"target":94},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":291,"end":292,"type":96},{"dimensions":297,"alt":299,"copyright":46,"url":300,"id":301,"edit":302},{"width":298,"height":298},40,"Phone icon","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":74,"y":74,"zoom":75,"background":184},{"title":304,"content":305,"icon":309},"Parcel cover",[306],{"type":81,"text":307,"spans":308,"direction":84},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":310,"alt":311,"copyright":46,"url":312,"id":313,"edit":314},{"width":298,"height":298},"Money icon","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":74,"y":74,"zoom":75,"background":76},{"title":316,"content":317,"icon":321},"Customs made easier",[318],{"type":81,"text":319,"spans":320,"direction":84},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":322,"alt":323,"copyright":46,"url":324,"id":325,"edit":326},{"width":298,"height":298},"Passport icon","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":74,"y":74,"zoom":75,"background":76},{"title":328,"content":329,"icon":333},"Flexible printing options",[330],{"type":81,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":84},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":334,"alt":335,"copyright":46,"url":336,"id":337,"edit":338},{"width":298,"height":298},"Printer icon","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":74,"y":74,"zoom":75,"background":76},{"title":340,"content":341,"icon":345},"Bulk send",[342],{"type":81,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":84},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":346,"alt":347,"copyright":46,"url":348,"id":349,"edit":350},{"width":298,"height":298},"Strapped boxes icon","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsU",{"x":74,"y":74,"zoom":75,"background":184},{"title":352,"content":353,"icon":357},"Trusted by top UK brands",[354],{"type":81,"text":355,"spans":356,"direction":84},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":358,"alt":359,"copyright":46,"url":360,"id":361,"edit":362},{"width":298,"height":298},"Success icon","switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":74,"y":74,"zoom":75,"background":184},{"theme":364,"title":365,"description":366},"standard","Why send internationally with Evri?","It doesn’t matter where your parcels are headed when you send with Evri internationally, you get access to all of the following benefits:","list_block$c334be9c-6583-4397-aea6-3a4064f1a914","list_block",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":370,"primary":372,"id":401,"slice_type":98,"slice_label":46},[371],{},{"CardAvatar":77,"CardTitle":373,"CardText":374,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":400,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Switzerland",[375,383],{"type":81,"text":376,"spans":377,"direction":84},"You can send all manner of items across the world with our Evri couriers, but there are some exceptions to this. You can find a full breakdown of what you can and can’t send to Switzerland on our prohibited items list, so be sure to check this before you send anything you’re unsure about.",[378,382],{"start":379,"end":380,"type":91,"data":381},196,217,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":94},{"start":379,"end":380,"type":96},{"type":81,"text":384,"spans":385,"direction":84},"On top of this, we recommend familiarising yourself with the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and UK Civil Aviation Authority guides, to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels to Switzerland via airlines.",[386,391,393,398],{"start":387,"end":388,"type":91,"data":389},61,93,{"link_type":36,"url":390,"target":94},"switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":387,"end":392,"type":96},94,{"start":394,"end":395,"type":91,"data":396},98,125,{"link_type":36,"url":397,"target":94},"switzerland.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":394,"end":399,"type":96},126,{"link_type":161},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":403,"primary":405,"id":449,"slice_type":98,"slice_label":46},[404],{},{"CardAvatar":77,"CardTitle":406,"CardText":407,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":448,"IsEco":20},"How to format an address when shipping from the UK to Switzerland",[408,411,414,417,420,423,426,431,436,441,445],{"type":81,"text":409,"spans":410},"When sending a parcel to Switzerland, you’ll need to format your package’s address in the following way:",[],{"type":138,"text":412,"spans":413},"The recipient’s name",[],{"type":138,"text":415,"spans":416},"The street name followed by the flat or house number",[],{"type":138,"text":418,"spans":419},"The four-digit postcode followed by the city or town",[],{"type":138,"text":421,"spans":422},"The country name in capitals",[],{"type":81,"text":424,"spans":425},"For example:",[],{"type":81,"text":427,"spans":428},"Mr J. Bloggs",[429],{"start":74,"end":430,"type":96},12,{"type":81,"text":432,"spans":433},"East Street, 38",[434],{"start":74,"end":435,"type":96},15,{"type":81,"text":437,"spans":438},"4007 Zurich",[439],{"start":74,"end":440,"type":96},11,{"type":81,"text":442,"spans":443},"SWITZERLAND",[444],{"start":74,"end":440,"type":96},{"type":81,"text":446,"spans":447},"But don’t worry, so long as you enter the right address information at checkout, we’ll make sure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label.",[],{"link_type":161},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":242,"version":31,"items":451,"primary":503,"id":505,"slice_type":506,"slice_label":46},[452,458,475,492],{"questionTitle":453,"questionBody":454},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Switzerland?",[455],{"type":81,"text":456,"spans":457,"direction":84},"The average delivery time for a parcel heading to Switzerland is 7-10 days.",[],{"questionTitle":459,"questionBody":460},"Will I need to deal with customs when posting to Switzerland?",[461,464,467],{"type":81,"text":462,"spans":463,"direction":84},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":81,"text":465,"spans":466,"direction":84},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":81,"text":468,"spans":469,"direction":84},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[470,474],{"start":471,"end":258,"type":91,"data":472},30,{"link_type":36,"url":473,"target":94},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":471,"end":258,"type":96},{"questionTitle":476,"questionBody":477},"Is there an import tax from the UK to Switzerland?",[478,481,484,487],{"type":81,"text":479,"spans":480,"direction":84},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":81,"text":482,"spans":483,"direction":84},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":81,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":84},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":81,"text":468,"spans":488,"direction":84},[489,491],{"start":471,"end":258,"type":91,"data":490},{"link_type":36,"url":473,"target":94},{"start":471,"end":258,"type":96},{"questionTitle":493,"questionBody":494},"Can I track my international parcels?",[495],{"type":81,"text":496,"spans":497,"direction":84},"Yes, we provide end-to-end tracking on all our parcels, even those being sent abroad. Just enter your tracking number on our international tracking page to see what stage of the journey your parcel is currently at.",[498,502],{"start":395,"end":499,"type":91,"data":500},152,{"link_type":36,"url":501,"t